1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,254
Muxlislar jamoasi tayyor!

2
00:00:02,274 --> 00:00:06,413
Har pozitsiyada eng ko‘p layk olgan o‘n bir muxlis — mana shular.

3
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:07,680
Afsuski...

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,360
ko‘pchiligi bizga follow bo‘lishmagan ekan...

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,320
haaay...

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:11,932
mayli.

7
00:00:11,952 --> 00:00:16,411
Zaxira o‘rinlar esa yon tomonda — keyingi eng ko‘p layk olganlar.

8
00:00:16,431 --> 00:00:18,887
Jamoaga faqat murabbiy yetishmayapti!

9
00:00:18,907 --> 00:00:21,167
Izohga yozing: men murabbiyman.

10
00:00:21,187 --> 00:00:24,641
Eng ko‘p layk olgan — muxlislar jamoasi murabbiyi bo‘ladi!

11
00:00:24,661 --> 00:00:27,798
ZAMIN FK — muxlislar jamoasiga qarshi.

12
00:00:27,818 --> 00:00:30,418
Obuna bo‘ling, keyingi qismni kutib qoling!

